window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>One simple mission. A dangerous mage. A dark deception that could spell disaster. </p> <p>Mother Nature always gets what she wants, and Sophie must locate the great mage Elowen before Mother's patience runs out. </p> <p>Guided by sensual but tormented Valor, Sophie, Carrigan, Hagan, and Jonas venture into the sacred wood to seek an audience with the mage. </p> <p>But the forest holds more secrets than anyone bargains for, and one unexpected truth will rock Sophie to her core. </p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
